    ("absolute", ["ab", "so", "lute"], "绝对的;完全的", "/ˈæb.sə.luːt/", "The researchers have absolute confidence in their experimental results.", "研究人员对实验结果有绝对的信心。", 18),
    ("absolutely", ["ab", "so", "lute", "ly"], "绝对地;完全地", "/ˈæb.sə.luːt.li/", "The new contract is absolutely essential for our expansion.", "新合同对我们的扩张绝对必要。", 19),
