    ("abundance", ["abun", "dance"], "丰富;充裕", "/əˈbʌn.dəns/", "The region has an abundance of natural resources and wildlife.", "该地区拥有丰富的自然资源和野生动物。", 25),
    ("abundant", ["abun", "dant"], "丰富的;充裕的", "/əˈbʌn.dənt/", "The region offers abundant opportunities for foreign investment.", "该地区为外国投资提供丰富的机会。", 26),
