    ("acceleration", ["ac", "cel", "er", "a", "tion"], "加速;加速度", "/əkˌsel.əˈreɪ.ʃən/", "The acceleration of climate change alarms scientists around the world.", "气候变化的加速令全世界科学家感到担忧。", 32),
    ("access", ["ac", "cess"], "访问权限;通道;进入", "/ˈæk.ses/", "Employees need a password to access the server.", "员工需要密码才能访问服务器。", 33),
