    ("consciousness", ["con", "scious", "ness"], "意识,知觉", "/ˈkɒn.ʃəs.nəs/", "The medication slowly restored his consciousness after surgery.", "药物在手术后慢慢恢复了他的意识。", 852),
    ("consecutive", ["con", "sec", "u", "tive"], "连续的;接连的", "/kənˈsek.jə.tɪv/", "Profits have risen for three consecutive quarters this year.", "利润今年已连续三个季度增长。", 853),
    ("consent", ["con", "sent"], "同意,许可", "/kənˈsent/", "Participants gave their written consent before joining the study.", "参与者在加入研究前给出了书面同意。", 854),
