    ("conservative", ["con", "ser", "va", "tive"], "保守的;谨慎的", "/kənˈsɜː.və.tɪv/", "The report gives a conservative estimate of next year's revenue.", "报告对明年的收入给出了保守估计。", 858),
    ("considerable", ["con", "sid", "er", "able"], "相当大的;可观的", "/kənˈsɪd.ər.ə.bəl/", "The project requires a considerable investment of time and money.", "这个项目需要投入相当多的时间和资金。", 859),
