    ("considerate", ["con", "sid", "er", "ate"], "体贴的,周到的", "/kənˈsɪd.ər.ət/", "It was very considerate of you to keep the noise down last night.", "你昨晚把噪音压低,真是很体贴。", 861),
    ("consideration", ["con", "sid", "er", "a", "tion"], "考虑,体谅", "/kənˌsɪd.əˈreɪ.ʃən/", "Safety is always the first consideration in building design.", "安全始终是建筑设计中首要的考虑。", 862),
    ("consign", ["con", "sign"], "交付,托运", "/kənˈsaɪn/", "The company consigned its goods to overseas distributors.", "公司把货物托运给海外分销商。", 863),
