    ("indebted", ["in", "debt", "ed"], "感激的,负债的", "/ɪnˈdet.ɪd/", "The charity is deeply indebted to its many volunteers.", "该慈善机构对其众多志愿者深表感激。", 2088),
    ("indefinite", ["in", "def", "i", "nite"], "无限期的,不明确的", "/ɪnˈdef.ə.nət/", "The project has been postponed for an indefinite period.", "该项目已被无限期推迟。", 2089),
    ("indefinitely", ["in", "def", "i", "nite", "ly"], "无限期地", "/ɪnˈdef.ə.nət.li/", "The flight has been delayed indefinitely due to bad weather.", "由于恶劣天气,航班被无限期延误。", 2090),
