    ("individual", ["in", "di", "vid", "u", "al"], "个人的;个别的;个人", "/ˌɪn.dɪˈvɪdʒ.u.əl/", "Each individual employee must complete the safety training.", "每位员工都必须完成安全培训。", 2102),
