    ("ingenuity", ["in", "ge", "nu", "ity"], "独创性,心灵手巧", "/ˌɪn.dʒəˈnjuː.ə.ti/", "Human ingenuity has solved many complex problems throughout history.", "人类的独创性在历史上解决了许多复杂问题。", 2134),
