    ("initiative", ["ini", "tia", "tive"], "主动性;倡议;新举措", "/ɪˈnɪʃ.ə.tɪv/", "Employees are encouraged to show initiative in solving problems.", "公司鼓励员工在解决问题时发挥主动性。", 2142),
    ("inject", ["in", "ject"], "注入;投入;注射", "/ɪnˈdʒekt/", "The government plans to inject funds into small businesses.", "政府计划向小企业注入资金。", 2143),
    ("injure", ["in", "jure"], "伤害,损害", "/ˈɪn.dʒər/", "Be careful not to injure your back when lifting heavy items.", "抬重物时要小心别伤到背部。", 2144),
