    ("injustice", ["in", "jus", "tice"], "不公正", "/ɪnˈdʒʌs.tɪs/", "Many movements have fought against social injustice throughout history.", "历史上许多运动都在与社会不公正作斗争。", 2146),
    ("inland", ["in", "land"], "内地的,内陆的", "/ˈɪn.lənd/", "The train travels to several inland towns and cities.", "火车开往几个内陆城镇。", 2147),
