    ("inspect", ["in", "spect"], "检查;视察;审查", "/ɪnˈspekt/", "Safety officials will inspect the factory next week.", "安全官员将于下周视察这家工厂。", 2161),
    ("inspection", ["in", "spec", "tion"], "检查,视察", "/ɪnˈspek.ʃən/", "The bridge is closed for a routine safety inspection.", "这座桥因例行安全检查而关闭。", 2162),
    ("inspector", ["in", "spec", "tor"], "检查员,巡视员", "/ɪnˈspek.tər/", "The local health inspector visited the restaurant kitchen completely unannounced.", "当地卫生检查员在毫无通知的情况下视察了餐厅厨房。", 2163),
