    ("institute", ["in", "sti", "tute"], "机构,学院", "/ˈɪn.stɪ.tjuːt/", "The research institute receives funding from several governments.", "该研究机构获得多个政府的资助。", 2172),
    ("institution", ["in", "sti", "tu", "tion"], "机构;制度;惯例", "/ˌɪn.stɪˈtjuː.ʃən/", "Banks are the oldest financial institutions in the region.", "银行是该地区历史最悠久的金融机构。", 2173),
